  "citation": "West T O; Post W M (2002): Soil Organic Carbon Sequestration by Tillage and Crop Rotation: A Global Data Analysis. Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/TCM.002",
  "dataset": {
